WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.160
Open the tray icon, then the gear, to
reach Settings.

2
00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:10.778
Sharing anonymous usage data and error
reports is on by default,

3
00:00:10.778 --> 00:00:12.987
with no file names or paths.

4
00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:15.494
Switch it off whenever you like.

5
00:00:16.064 --> 00:00:20.280
Send feedback opens the feedback form with
your app version.

6
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:25.617
Copy details puts your version and a
reference code on the clipboard,

7
00:00:25.617 --> 00:00:27.620
and nothing is sent anywhere.
